<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  // Moved off is:inline (2026-05-14) so Astro extracts this to a hashed,
  // long-cached, deferred module bundle (`/_astro/*.js`) instead of inlining
  // ~6.5 KiB into every HTML response (Header.astro is global, so every page
  // benefits). Module scripts are deferred by default; the auth-resolved class
  // toggle still fires before user interaction.
  // @ts-nocheck silences strict-null/implicit-any in vanilla-JS callbacks that
  // previously skipped TS via the is:inline directive (no runtime change).
  // Dropdown: mark as entered after first hover so exit uses subtle -4px
